# party — members stand apart, and a fight takes only those standing where it breaks out
#
# Each member of the party has their own area in a place: a move moves the member who made it and
# nobody else. The hyena is sent out to the field alone, by an act of its own, while the protagonist
# stays in the yard; each is then where it was left, with its own token on its own card.
#
# A fight is fought by the members standing in the area where it begins. The protagonist strikes the
# farmer in the yard: the hyena, a field away, is not on the board — and is still in the field, and
# in the party, when the fight is over.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --fill-party --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --location-type test --location-id 0 --npc-static --start-area "Test Yard" --period noon

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180

# Both enter by the yard.
expect-state party member Kenryc Greygate area=Test Yard
expect-state party member Brindletail area=Test Yard

# The hyena walks out to the field, by an act of its own.
click member Brindletail
wait
expect [BRINDLETAIL]
strategy succeed
goal move
click observe "Test Field"
choose birdsong
advance 12 180
click think "Test Field"
choose birdsong
advance 12 180
click act move
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect Moved to: Test Field
click continue
advance 12 180

# Only the hyena moved.
expect-state party member Brindletail area=Test Field
expect-state party member Kenryc Greygate area=Test Yard

# The protagonist, still in the yard, picks a fight there.
click member Kenryc
wait
expect [KENRYC GREYGATE]
expect-state where Test Yard
goal attack
# The plowman is watching: only a discreet means may try a blow in front of him.
means stealth
click observe "farmer"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "farmer"
choose ripelore
advance 12 180
click act attack
choose 0
advance 12 180
click continue
advance 12 180
expect First blow:
click continue
wait mode Fighting 60

# The hyena is a field away: it is not on the board.
regions
expect-not Brindletail

fight-end victory
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180

# The fight over, each is where it was, and the hyena is still of the party.
expect-state party member Brindletail area=Test Field
expect-state party member Kenryc Greygate area=Test Yard
expect-state party companion Brindletail
quit
